---
description: Keep frontend PrimeReact tables typographically consistent
globs: frontend/src/**/*.{tsx,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

# PrimeReact Table Typography

- Every PrimeReact `DataTable` must include the shared `app-data-table` class.
- Keep table header and body cell font sizes unified through `frontend/src/index.css`.
- Do not add local `text-xs` or `text-sm` classes inside table cells.
- Cell-level classes may still handle color, mono font, width, truncation, whitespace, and alignment.
- If a table needs different typography, document that design decision in `Guidelines.md` before implementing it.
